  id: SeaDeepHarvester
  displayName: Deep-Sea Harvester
  description: A white hub sending harvester drones out to shoals 22 tiles away,
    guided by sonar. Its boats go out to the fish shoals in reach (silver glints
    on the water); the richer they are, the bigger the catch. Shoals fished hard
    thin out and move on, and regrow when left alone.
